# Project map

**iqms-complaintmanagement-redesign** — documentation-first repo. Sequence: as-is process → requirements → architecture → functional spec → design spec → n8n workflows.

| Work | Path |
| --- | --- |
| Overview | `docs/00-overview/` |
| As-is process | `docs/01-current-process/` |
| Requirements | `docs/02-requirements/` |
| Architecture | `docs/03-architecture/` |
| Functional spec | `docs/04-functional-spec/` |
| Design spec | `docs/05-design-spec/` |
| ADRs | `docs/06-decisions/` |
| n8n JSON | `workflows/` |
| Env notes | `config/` |

## Rules

- Keep as-is and to-be in separate files. As-is only in `docs/01-current-process/`.
- Do not invent architecture or n8n workflows until requirements are agreed.
- Prefer Markdown in `docs/`. Link glossary terms from `docs/02-requirements/glossary.md`.
- Never commit secrets, credentials, or production complaint / PII data.
- Link SharePoint Draw.io files; do not copy binaries unless asked.
- New interviews: `docs/templates/process-interview.md` → `docs/01-current-process/sources/`.
